  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-label=\"Pixel counter\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2e3250;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --accent-hover: #ffe08a;\n  --accent-pressed: #e6b85c;\n  --border: #5a5e7a;\n  --shadow: #0d0e16;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\n.title {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  background: var(--accent-pressed);\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    min-width: 56px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA fully offline, pixel-styled counter web app built with only HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count of 0.\n- Buttons to increase (+1), decrease (−1), and reset to 0.\n- Supports negative numbers.\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with visible focus, hover, and pressed states.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width.\n- Pixel-art aesthetic using CSS (borders, box-shadows, system fonts).\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab to focus and Enter/Space to activate.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – Structure with required IDs: `increase`, `decrease`, `reset`, `count`.\n- `styles.css` – Pixel-style theme and responsive layout.\n- `script.js` – Counter logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Technical Notes\n\n- No inline event handlers.\n- No external assets, imports, or storage.\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n- Color palette: dark background, card, accent, border, and shadow tones.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
